OL,3,GNEWSAResidents left without water after
OL,4,Apipe bursts
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been left without water
OL,7,Fafter a pipe burst on Tuesday evening.
OL,9,FSevern Trent has apologised to those
OL,10,Fexperiencing no supply, poor pressure
OL,11,For discoloured water supply in the GL50
OL,12,Farea, which covers central parts of
OL,13,FCheltenham, Gloucestershire.
OL,15,FThe burst pipe has led to the closure
OL,16,Fof the A40 London Road from where it
OL,17,Fmeets Old Bath Road and Hales Road, to
OL,18,Fthe A435 Cirencester Road, and Severn
OL,19,FTrent said the repair is taking "a
OL,20,Flittle longer than we first
OL,21,Fanticipated".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
