OL,3,GNEWSAResidents left without water after
OL,4,Apipe bursts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said: "Teams in the area
OL,7,Fare working to restore water supply by
OL,8,Fmoving water around the network, which
OL,9,Fmay lead to lower water pressure or
OL,10,Fdiscoloured water as the supply
OL,11,Freturns."
